<div class="wrapper">

  <main>
    <section class="hello">
      {# Letterhead. The sprig holds the spot until there's a photo to put there. #}
      {% if photo %}
        <img class="portrait" src="{{ photo }}" alt="Andrew Lum" width="128" height="128">
      {% else %}
        {% include "sprig.njk" %}
      {% endif %}
      <h1 class="hi">
        Welcome to my little corner of the web
        <span class="wave" role="img" aria-label="waving hand">👋</span>
      </h1>
      <p>
        I build software, and the teams that build it. Most recently I was
        Director of Engineering at Findigs, where I led product engineering on
        a platform that made renting an apartment faster and fairer. These days
        I'm building <a href="https://satsuma.works">Studio Satsuma</a>, a
        small studio for the apps I've wanted to exist.
      </p>
      <p>
        I'm drawn to problems where technology can produce a better outcome for
        the people on the other end of it. Wrestling with a hairy
        architecture or engineering team problem? Let's talk!
      </p>
      <p>
        Outside of work, I love to move. You'll usually find me climbing,
        cooking, running, dancing, or practicing handstands in the park. Most
        of the time, in Brooklyn.
      </p>
    </section>

    {% if collections.fieldnotes.length %}
    <section>
      <h2 class="label">Field Notes · notes on technical leadership</h2>
      <ul class="notes">
        {%- for note in collections.fieldnotes.slice(0, 3) %}
        <li><a href="{{ note.url }}">{{ note.data.title }}</a></li>
        {%- endfor %}
        <li class="more"><a href="/field-notes/">All notes →</a></li>
      </ul>
    </section>
    {% endif %}

    <section>
      <h2 class="label">If you'd like to know more</h2>
      <ul class="links">
        <li>
          <a href="https://satsuma.works">Studio Satsuma</a>
          <span class="note">the studio where I build and ship small apps</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://andlum.com/sik-fan-lah/">Sik Fan Lah</a>
          <span class="note">dinner party menus, and the recipes behind them</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://github.com/andlum">GitHub</a>
          <span class="note">side projects, in varying states of repair</span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <a href="https://linkedin.com/in/andlum">LinkedIn</a>
          <span class="note">the professional-shaped version of me, with the full work history. The best place to reach me.</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </section>
  </main>

